  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> with a, b of same sign.<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br />If <math><mi>x</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence real or purely imaginary number can not satisfy <math><mi>P</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>"
  }
